  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PhD Student meeting 13 nov -17</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PhD Student meeting 13 nov</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop for PhD students participating in bilateral cooperation. The workshop is organised in cooperation with International Science Programmes, ISP. The purpose of the workshop is to:
1) give the students inspiring examples of scientific communcation
2) give possibilities for the students to exchange experiences
3)strenghten the network of PhD students.
The contribution is a continuation of a similar seminar in October 2016, which was very appreciated. This workshop builds on the experiences from that seminar and the feed back from participants.
The major part of this event is financed by ISP. This contribution regards the financing of meals (fruit, coffee, lunch).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Workshop f&#xf6;r doktorander som ing&#xe5;r i de bilaterala forskningssamarbetena, organiseras ihop
med ISP. Workshopen samlar ett hundratal doktorander fr&#xe5;n de sex samarbetsl&#xe4;nderna d&#xe4;r
Sida st&#xf6;djer bilateralt forskningssamarbete, samt ISP&apos;s doktorander.
Syftena med workshopen &#xe4;r:
1) att ge doktoranderna inspirerande exempel p&#xe5; vetenskapskommunikation
2) att doktoranderna kan utbyta erfarenheter sinsemellan
3) st&#xe4;rka doktorandernas n&#xe4;tverk
Insatsen &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; ett liknande seminarium oktober 2016 vilket var mycket
uppskattat bland doktoranderna. Insatsen bygger p&#xe5; denna erfarenhet och deltagarnas
&#xe5;terkoppling.
D&#xe5; den st&#xf6;rsta delen planeras av ISP, handlar detta beslutet om finansieringen av eventets
m&#xe5;ltider (frukt, kaffe, lunchbuff&#xe9;, kaffe). En totalkostnad om ca 27 000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
